Provenance of nfswolf-nfs4
==========================

This crate is original NFSWolf work (Apache-2.0). It implements NFS version 4.0 (RFC 7530)
directly from the RFC and contains no code derived from any upstream project.

It builds on nfswolf-xdr, which do carry code derived from the
Vaiz/nfs3 project <https://github.com/Vaiz/nfs3> (Unlicense); see the NOTICE
file shipped with that crate.
